"Claude Code isn't on this Mac. Takes can install it for you from Anthropic; no password needed." = "Claude Code tiada pada Mac ini. Takes boleh memasangnya untuk anda daripada Anthropic, tanpa kata laluan.";
"Claude Code's download isn't available from here. Anthropic lists where it is at anthropic.com/supported-countries." = "Muat turun Claude Code tidak tersedia dari sini. Anthropic menyenaraikan tempat ia tersedia di anthropic.com/supported-countries.";
