"So the hotkey is ready without opening Takes first. Change it any time in Settings › General." = "Supaya kekunci pintas sedia tanpa perlu membuka Takes dahulu. Tukar pada bila-bila masa dalam Seting › Umum.";
"something that isn't Takes is already at %@" = "sesuatu yang bukan Takes sudah ada di %@";
"Sorry about that. Reporting it helps fix it: Takes opens a bug report on GitHub with where it stopped, and shows the full crash report in Finder to attach." = "Maaf tentang itu. Melaporkannya membantu membetulkannya: Takes membuka laporan pepijat di GitHub dengan tempat ia berhenti, dan menunjukkan laporan ranap penuh dalam Finder untuk dilampirkan.";
"Takes is already in Applications." = "Takes sudah ada dalam Aplikasi.";
